                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1559/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1559/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1559> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1559/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The quarterly outlook survey in the building trades is conducted among craftspeople working in the construction of individual homes and various buildings, general masonry work, wood framing and roofing, and installation and finishing.\n\nMore precisely, the survey covers the sectors defined by the following NAF Rev.2 codes: 41.2, 43.2, 43.3, 43.9."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1668> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2016-02-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1668> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The collection takes place by post, with the possibility to respond through an e-mailed, mailed or faxed questionnaire from April to June of the given year.  \nThe questionnaire is different depending on whether the company is mono -regional and mono- institution, mono -regional multi-establishment or multi-regional.  \nThe geographical reference area is the Large Southwest of France (departments 09, 12, 24, 31, 32, 33, 33, 40, 46, 47, 64, 65, 81, 82)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/I.18.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/I.18.7/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/I.18.7/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1668> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/I.18.10/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/I.18.10/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1668> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/I.18.12/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/284> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The following topics are covered:  \n- Relations with the aeronautics and space industry (function, range, customers)  \n- Outlook (order book, recruitments)  \n- Human resources (managers, temporary staff)  \n- Relation to innovation, certification, quality"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Les thèmes suivants sont abordés :  \n- relations avec la filière AS (fonction, rang, clients)  \n- perspectives (carnet de commande, recrutements)  \n- ressources humaines (cadres, intérim)  \n- rapport à l'innovation, la certification, la qualité"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1668> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey is comprehensive for the field of the aerospace industry's \"core\" (3030Z, 5122Z), \"partial\" sectors'sunits (2051Z, 2562B, 2651A, 3316Z), units of more than 20 employees in  \"potential \" sector (40 NAF classes of activity). The survey asks survey units with fewer than 20 employees belonging to the 'potential'sectors. Specific units known as belonging to a priori the sector are also interviewed."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Le périmètre conventionnel de la filière aéronautique et spatiale est défini par les unités des secteurs du « noyau » de la filière AS (3030Z, 5122Z), les unités des secteurs « partiel » (2051Z, 2562B, 2651A, 3316Z), et les unités des secteurs « potentiel » (40 classes d'activités NAF)."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1668/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/A> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1668> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/284>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire de l'enquête sur la filière Aéronautique et Spatiale dans le Grand Sud-Ouest 2015"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/DOC_ENQ_AERONAUTIQUE_ESPACE_FOURNISSEURS_QUEST_2015.pdf> .
    
