            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The questionnaire will consider primarily from qualitative issues the following topics:\n\n- the social , the fight against discrimination in the company, social dialogue;  \n- Societal : relationships with customers , suppliers , civil society ;  \n- Corporate governance and internal organization ;  \n- Environmental : fight against climate change , thrifty management of resources and energy, preservation of the natural environment.\n\n "@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
