            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "As in previous editions of the survey, the questionnaire was divided into five sections:   \n- professional mobility;   \n- initial training;   \n- continuing training;   \n- social origin;   \n- income from work."@en ;
