<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1772> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1772/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "When it submits its first declaration of the start-up of a non-salaried activity, the enterprise or corporate body is registered in the directory and receives a unique identification number: the SIREN.\n\nThe appearance of a legal operating unit with no predecessor (except for agriculture, which is not considered in the calculation) is considered to be a newly created enterprise.\n\nSince 1st January 2007, the concept of creation adopted by INSEE is based on the implementation of new means of production. It corresponds to the concept defined by EUROSTAT.\n\nThe business start-up series according to this new concept is recalculated into the \"NA\" aggregated classification since the year 2000, which serves for the analysis of data over a long period.\n\nThe business start-up statistics include applications for start-ups as \"auto-entrepreneurs\" (new, simplified self-employment status), starting from the data relating to January 2009."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/623> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1772/S.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1772> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1772>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Rapport qualité : Créations d'entreprises"@fr , "Quality report: Business start-ups"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/produits/indicateur/p1631> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1772/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Since 1st January 2007, the CVS-CJO data (correction for seasonal variations and for calendar effects) are created according to a specific method which is used to improve the correction for seasonal variations, especially those relating to the changes of administrative context that have occurred in recent years.  \nThere is no CVS-CJO data for the start-ups as \"auto-entrepreneurs\" series because this status is too recent.\n\nThe data for a given month may undergo slight modifications during the processing of the following month(s) but become final on the third month."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1772/S.2.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.2.3>
                    "2015-02-18"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1772> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1772/S.18.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/frequence/M> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1772> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/98>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Les créations d'entreprises"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
