<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1554> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.18.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.18.3/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.18.3/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey is biennial and each survey covers a three-year period.  \nCIS2014 covers the three years 2012, 2013 and 2014.  \nIt took place between June and December 2015.  \nCollection on the Internet is preferred. However, companies that request it are given the opportunity to reply on paper."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.1.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.3>
                    "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@fr , "<p>Fran&ccedil;ois-Xavier Dussud</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.12>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/I.18.12/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The CIS2014 sample is taken directly from the SIRUS directory.  \nIt consists of approximately 23,000 units. It includes an exhaustive part (legal units with a minimum of 250 employees or more). The sampling design is stratified according to the crossover of activity and the number of employees."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "CIS2014 covers the following activities (NAF rev. 2):  \n- Manufacturing, mining and quarrying and other industrial activities (sections B to E)  \n- Construction (section F)  \n- Wholesale and retail trade, transportation and storage (section G)  \n- Transports (section H)  \n- Accommodation and food service activities (section I)  \n- Information and communication (section J)  \n- Financial and insurance activities (section K)  \n- Real estate activities (section L)  \n- Professional, scientific, technical, administrative and support service activities ; public administration and defence, education, human health and social work activities (sections M and N except 75 and 82)"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Les principaux thèmes abordés dans l'enquête CIS 2014 sont les suivants :  \n- Fréquence de l'innovation par type d'innovation (produits, procédés, organisation, marketing),  \n- Part en chiffre d'affaires (2014) des innovations de produits introduites entre 2012 et 2014,  \n- Dépenses liées aux activités d'innovation de produits et de procédés,  \n- Existence de financements publics (nationaux, européens),  \n- Formes de coopération pour le développement des innovations,  \n- Droits de propriété intellectuelle (dépôt de brevet, enregistrement de modèle etc.),  \n- Entreprises non-innovantes : facteurs expliquant l'absence d'innovation sur la période 2012-2014,  \n- Innovations apportant des bénéfices environnementaux."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.11.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.2>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.11.2/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1554/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/geo/pays/france> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1554> .
    
