            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Precision calculations are calculated on the main variables broadcast (the quantities of waste by combined categories).  \nThe precision indicators (coefficient of variation, 95% confidence interval) take into account errors due to sampling, total non-response correction and calibration, but not the error related to partial non-response correction.  \nThe results of the calculations are in the file \"S.13.1. Calculs_precision_dech16_com.xls\"."@en ;
