    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1653/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The main topics studied through the survey are:  \n- characteristics of the resources of young adults aged 18 to 24 years : nature, frequency and amount;  \n- inventory of the aid received and provided by the parents of the young adult (and optionally by other households or individuals);  \n- the resources needed for young adults to become self-sufficient;  \n- the weight of support for young adults in the budget of parents;  \n- the relationship between young adults and their parents."@en ;
