                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1942> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1942/S.10.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "[The French business survey on the situation and outlook in industry : methodology (April 2007)](https://www.insee.fr/en/information/2579489)  \n"@en ;
