            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey on government employees collects, on its field of interest, the individual characteristics of employees relating to:  \n- the training level;  \n- the career path before and after entering the civil service;  \n- the actual working time, taking account of days off of various types and other days not worked;  \n- the family situation, the household income and information on origins."@en ;
