    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "A consultation committee met to take an active part in the questionnaire’s design. Its member are experts and representatives of public policies interested in ICT and e-commerce questions (SOeS, SSP, DGE, CCIP, ARCEP, SGMAP, Télécom Paris Tech…), as well as representatives for syndicates of businesses and trade unions (FEVAD, Syntec Numérique, Medef, CCIP, CPME, CGT, FO…)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1858/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The sampling base is the Sirus register (Identification system for the Statistical Units in the Register).  \n\nThe sample is stratified by business sector and by size and, since 2012, by turnover. Depending on the survey year, approximately 12,500 businesses are surveyed."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
