    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.11.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey shows a declining response rate: 80.4% (88.8% in the previous edition due to the additional sample surveyed in 2016). The latter implied a higher sampling rate in small groups, where the response rate is always lower.\n\nBefore any exploitation, it is also useful to assess the quality of the variables through their partial non-response rate and confidence intervals provided in the survey quality indicators."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "A consultative committee met every year. It is composed, in addition to the two producer services, by experts and representatives of the public policies concerned with energy issues, representatives of professional organizations, employee unions and the energy sector."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
