    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.15.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The data from the EACEI 2016 survey can be partly supplemented by ECEI-PE 2014 by being vigilant as to the differences in scope: ECEI-PE, in addition to the one-year lag, surveys establishments with 1 to 19 employees and focuses only on a limited number of energies."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1628>
