            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/DOC_EACEI_quest_2016.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1628/S.16/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The label committee ensures that the survey does not place an excessive burden on respondents.  \nIn addition, other decisions were made to limit the burden on respondents:    \n- the EACEI 2016 sample is the same as this of 2015, because of the EACEI 2015 extension;  \n- the part of the EACEI 2016 sample is negatively coordinated with the thematics enterprises surveys;  \n- collection is done electronically;  \n- the sample of the extension collected at the end of the year (second wave) was not intended to be interviewed by a panel and was therefore drawn independently of the numbers of the previous surveys."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
