                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-F201> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1932> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1932/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "L’ensemble des salariés de la fonction publique d’État (ministères et établissements publics administratifs) hors militaires, quel que soit leur statut (fonctionnaire, contractuel, vacataire, stagiaire rémunéré et autre y compris apprenti et en contrat aidé), actifs au moins un jour durant l’année 2018."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1932/S.3.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.3.5>
                    "The survey unit is the employee."@en , "L’unité enquêtée est le salarié."@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1932> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1932/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "All employees of the State public service (ministries and public administrative services) except military personnel, irrespective of their status (official, contractual, casual, paid trainee and other status, including apprentices and subsidized contracts), active at least one day during the year 2018."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1932/S.3.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "This survey, in conjunction with the \"information system on public services\" (SIASP in French), will complete the coverage of non-market sectors in Sections O and P of NACE rev. 2 (Public Administration and Education)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1932/S.1.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
