            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The IRL \"corresponds to the mean of consumer prices excluding tobacco and excluding rents over the last twelve months\"."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
