    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.1.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.5>
                    "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, CS 70058, 92541 MONTROUGE CEDEX FRANCE</p>"@fr , "<p>Insee, 88 avenue Verdier, CS 70058, 92541 MONTROUGE CEDEX FRANCE</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey responds to the European Regulation on structural business statistics (EC N°251/2009) of 11 March 2009, requesting environmental protection expenditure broken down by environmental domain, activity and size of enterprise."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.11.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "- Contrôles pendant la phase de collecte  \n- Relances pendant la phase de collecte : relances par courrier exhaustives sur les non-répondants, relances téléphoniques priorisées sur les non-répondants de grande taille  \n- Apurement pour assurer la cohérence des réponses au sein de chaque questionnaire  \n- Winsorisation : contrôle de l'influence des unités atypiques  \n- Calcul d'indicateurs de précision"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.13.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The precision indicators (standard deviation, coefficient of variation, 95% confidence interval) take into account errors due to sampling, total non-response correction and calibration, but not the error related to partial non-response correction.\n\nThe variables used for the Antipol 2017 precision calculations are:  \n- TOT_ETUDE (total amount of studies to protect the environment)  \n- TI (total amount of specific investments)  \n- I2 (amount of integrated environmental protection investments)  \n- TOT_INVEST (amount of total investments)\n\nFor quantitative variables in volume, the indicators are as follows:  \ntotal  \nCoefficient of variation (CV) in percent = 100 * s / total  \n95% confidence interval (CI) = [total +/- 1.96 s].\n\nNote: sometimes the lower bound of the confidence interval is negative. This means that the normal approximation used in the confidence interval formula (factor 1.96) is not valid. In this case, the unweighted total observed on the sample was used as the lower bound value, and therefore the confidence interval is no longer centred around the estimator value.\n\nThe results of the calculations are in the file \"Calculs de precision 2017\"(fr)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/1114> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.5/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.8.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.8.3>
                    "<p>Les donn&eacute;es sont publi&eacute;es annuellement dans les collections &laquo;&nbsp;Insee Focus&nbsp;&raquo;, &laquo;&nbsp;Insee R&eacute;sultats&nbsp;&raquo;.</p>"@fr , "<p>The data are published annually in the collections \"Insee Focus\", \"Insee Results\".</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.6.3>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.6.3>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/statutEnquete/T> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "La base de sondage est le Système d’immatriculation au répertoire des unités statistiques (Sirus).  \nLa méthode d'échantillonnage est un plan stratifié par secteur d'activité, taille d'unité et localisation (depuis l'année de référence 2014). Les allocations sont optimisées sur les montants des études et des investissements des enquêtes précédentes (allocations de Neyman). Elles sont exhaustives au-delà d'un certain seuil."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>- les montants d'&eacute;tudes et d'investissements sont ceux r&eacute;alis&eacute;s au cours du dernier exercice comptable clos en 2017<br />- l'effectif de l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement est celui au 31/12/2017<br />- les informations concernant le classement/la certification de l'&eacute;tablissement concernent l'ann&eacute;e 2017 (INSTCLAS, AUTORIS, ISO, ENVOIE, AUT_CERTIF, EFF_ENV, SERV1)<br />- le reste des donn&eacute;es qualitatives &ndash; Informations g&eacute;n&eacute;rales du cadre A &ndash; porte sur la situation de l'entreprise au moment de r&eacute;pondre &agrave; l'enqu&ecirc;te (juin &agrave; octobre 2018)</p>"@fr , "<p>- the amounts of studies and investments are those carried out during the last financial year ended in 2017<br />- the staff of the establishment is that at 31/12/2017<br />- the information concerning the classification/certification of the establishment concern the year 2017 (INSTCLAS, AUTORIS, ISO, ENVOIE, AUT_CERTIF, EFF_ENV, SERV1)<br />- the rest of the qualitative data &ndash;General information of framework A&ndash; relates to the situation of the company at the time of answering the survey (June to October 2018)</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/913>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Questionnaire de l'enquête sur les investissements et les dépenses courantes pour protéger l'environnement en 2017"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2018-04-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/I.18.6.Questionnaire_Antipol2017.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.1.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.1.4>
                    "<p>Chef de la division ETET</p>"@fr , "<p>Head of division ETET</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.7.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Law n° 51-711 of 7 June 1951 on obligations, co-ordination and confidentiality in respect of statistics. Available from <https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/affichTexte.do?cidTexte=JORFTEXT000000888573>.\n\nArticle 6 concerns statistical confidentiality: Subject to the provisions of Articles 40, 56, 76, 97 and 99 of the Code of Criminal Procedure and those of Article L. 213-3 of the French Heritage Code, the individual information contained in the questionnaires endorsed as provided for in Article 2 of this Law and relating to private and family life and, in general, to private acts and conduct can not, unless decided by the Archives Administration, after examining the opinion of the Statistical Confidentiality Committee and relating to a request made for the purposes of public statistics or scientific or historical research, be the subject of any communication by the depositary service before the expiry of a period of seventy-five years following the date of completion of the survey or a period of twenty-five years from the death of the person concerned, whichever is the shorter.  \nA Statistical Confidentiality Committee is set up. This committee is called upon to rule on any question relating to the confidentiality of statistics. It expresses its opinion on requests for the communication of individual data collected pursuant to this law. The committee is chaired by a State Councillor, appointed by the Vice-President of the Council of State. It includes in particular representatives of the French National Assembly and Senate. The composition and operating methods of the committee are set by decree of the Council of State. Recipients of the data communications resulting from Ministerial decisions made after consulting the Statistical Confidentiality Committee agree to not communicate these data to anyone. Any violation of the provisions of this paragraph is punishable by the penalties provided for in Article 226-13 of the Penal Code."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1889>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Quality report: Survey on environmental protection studies and investments 2017"@en , "Rapport qualité : Enquête sur les investissements dans l'industrie pour protéger l'environnement 2017"@fr ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#target>
                    <http://bauhaus/operations/operation/s1434> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Les établissements appartiennent aux divisions 05 à 35 de la NAF rév. 2."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.18.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.4/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.18.4/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
