    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "These are industrial establishments with 20 or more employees, belonging to sections B, C, D of NAF rev.2.\n\nThe sample is in the order of 11,000 units (divided into 9,000 on the field excluding LPN and sawmills, 2,000 on the field LPN and sawmills)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.11.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The different stages of the survey ensure that the process meets the requirements for statistical production:  \n- stratified sample selection  \n- reminders and checks of data being collected  \n- clearance  \n- adjustment for total non-response  \n- shimming  \n- adjustment for partial non-response  \n- winsorisation  (control of the influence of atypical units)  \n- the questionnaire was tested (in the 4th quarter 2012) as part of the survey's appearance before the label committee in early 2013"@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.10.3/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "L'Insee Focus et l'Insee Résultats sont disponibles sur le site insee.fr."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1889/S.3.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
