    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1975/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The enterprises surveyed are enterprises established on French territory (metropolitan France and overseas departments including Mayotte), active on 31/12/2020 having had at least 6 months of activity, merchants, operators with 10 or more employees (in FTE).    \n\nThe companies belong to divisions 05 to 81 of the Statistical Classification of Economic Activities in the European Community (NACE rev.2, with the exception of 75: veterinary surgeons).  Within Section K of NACE rev.2 (Divisions 64, 65 and 66), sections 5195, 6595 are excluded."@en ;
