    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1734/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>La p&eacute;riode de r&eacute;f&eacute;rence est 2012 pour la plupart des questions&nbsp;; le dernier exercice comptable (2011) pour le commerce &eacute;lectronique.</p>"@fr , "<p>The reference period is mainly 2012 except for the characteristics referring to the previous accounting year (turnover, websales).</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1734> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1734/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "A consultation committee met to take an active part in the questionnaire’s design. Its member are experts and representatives of public policies interested in ICT and e-commerce questions (SOeS, SSP, DGE, CCIP, ARCEP, SGMAP, Télécom Paris Tech…), as well as representatives for syndicates of businesses and trade unions (FEVAD, Syntec Numérique, Medef, CCIP, CGPME, CGT, FO…)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
