            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1929> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1929/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The main themes addressed are:   \n- investments: business leaders are asked about the amounts of their investments over the last 3 years;  \n- their motivation;  \n- the factors influencing investment decisions;  \n- their production capacities."@en ;
