            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "- Quarterly : localised unemployment rates by region, department and employment area in Metropolitan France;  \n-  Annual : localised unemployment rates by region, department and employment area in overseas departments (except Mayotte) ; in average on the year for overseas department since 2014."@en ;
