                    "<p>Quarterly : <br />- regions and d&eacute;partments of metropolitan France&nbsp;: since the first quarter of 1982<br />- employment area of metropolitan France : since the first quarter of 2002<br />Annual&nbsp;:<br />- regions and departments of metropolitan France : since the first quarter of 1982<br />- employment area of of metropolitan France : since 2003<br />- Overseas departments (except Mayotte) : since 2003 (in average on the year from 2014)</p>"@en , "<p>&nbsp;En trimestriel : <br />- d&eacute;partements et r&eacute;gions de France m&eacute;tropolitaine&nbsp;: depuis le premier trimestre 1982<br />- zone d'emploi de France m&eacute;tropolitaine&nbsp;: depuis le premier trimestre 2002<br />En annuel&nbsp;:<br />- d&eacute;partements et r&eacute;gions de France m&eacute;tropolitaine&nbsp;: depuis 1982<br />- zone d'emploi de France m&eacute;tropolitaine&nbsp;: depuis 2003<br />- d&eacute;partements d'outre-mer&nbsp;(hors Mayotte) : 2003 (en moyenne annuelle depuis 2014)</p>"@fr ;
