    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.18.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "- Controls during the collection phase  \n- Follow-ups during the collection phase: exhaustive reminders by mail on non-respondents, priority telephone reminders on large non-respondents  \n- Clearance to ensure consistency of responses within each questionnaire  \n- Winsorisation: control of the influence of atypical units  \n- Calculation of precision indicators"@en ;
