    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/I.18.7/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The collection period ran from June 16 to October 28, 2016."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/I.20>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.20>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/I.20/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1837> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.1.1>
                    <http://bauhaus/organisations/insee/DG75-E001> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1837> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.13.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The out-of-field share in the sample is 2.1%. It is estimated at 2.8% in the sampling frame."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The frame is the statistical directory of companies (SIRUS).\n\nThe sampling method is stratification by industry, unit size and location (since the reference year 2014). The allocations are optimized on the amounts of research and investment in previous surveys (Neyman allocation). They are completeness beyond a certain threshold."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.13.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The precision indicators (standard deviation, coefficient of variation, 95% confidence interval) take into account errors due to sampling, total non-response correction, calibration and winsorisation, but not the error related to partial non-response correction.\n\nThe variables used for the precision calculations on Antipol 2015 are:  \n- TOT_ETUDE ( total amount of studies to protect the environment)  \n- IT (total amount of specific investments)  \n- I2 (total amount of integrated investments)  \n- TOT_INVEST ( Total investments = IT + I2)\n\nFor quantitative variables in volume, the indicators are as follows:  \ntotal  \nCoefficient of variation (CV) in percent = 100 * s / total  \n95% confidence interval (CI) =[total +/- 1.96 s].\n\nNote: sometimes the lower bound of the confidence interval is negative. This means that the normal approximation used in the confidence interval formula (factor 1.96) is not valid. In this case, the unweighted total observed on the sample was used as the lower bound value, and therefore the confidence interval is no longer centred around the estimator value."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.10.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.5>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.10.5/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.10.5/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1837> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.3.6/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.3.6/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1837> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The themes focus on investments (hardware entirely dedicated to environmental protection, purchases of production facilities more efficient in terms of environmental issues...), studies (regulatory or investment-related) and current expenditure (collected every 3 years), destined for environmental protection.\n\nThis expenditure is allocated according to the areas concerned:  \n- Waste water  \n- Air protection  \n- Limiting greenhouse gas emissions  \n- Wastes  \n- Noises and vibrations  \n- Soils; ground and surface water  \n- Sites, landscapes and biodiversity  \n- Other fields."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/S.5>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/simsv2/attribute/S.5>
                    "<p>- Les montants d'&eacute;tudes et d'investissements sont ceux r&eacute;alis&eacute;s au cours du dernier exercice comptable clos en 2018, l'effectif de l&rsquo;&eacute;tablissement est celui au 31/12/2018, les informations concernant le classement/la certification de l'&eacute;tablissement concernent l'ann&eacute;e 2018 (INSTCLAS, AUTORIS, ISO, ENVOIE, AUT_CERTIF, EFF_ENV, SERV1), le reste des donn&eacute;es qualitatives - Informations g&eacute;n&eacute;rales du cadre A - porte sur la situation de l'entreprise au moment de r&eacute;pondre &agrave; l'enqu&ecirc;te (juin &agrave; octobre 2019).</p>"@fr , "<p>The amounts of studies and investments are those carried out during the last financial year ended in 2018, the staff of the establishment is that at 31/12/2018, the information concerning the classification/certification of the establishment concern the year 2018 (INSTCLAS, AUTORIS, ISO, ENVOIE, AUT_CERTIF, EFF_ENV, SERV1), the rest of the qualitative data - General information of framework A - relates to the situation of the company at the time of answering the survey (June to October 2019).</p>"@en ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1837> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1837/I.18.12>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
