            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The EAP is conducted by SSNE (National Service of Enterprise Statistics) in the Basse-Normandie regional service.  \nThe data are entirely collected online. However, the possibility of responding by postal mail is offered."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
