    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1923/S.3.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The questions relate to the evolution of the demand for housing addressed to companies, the number of housing starts, the number of permits requested or even land prices.\n\nOther questions, asked only about sales activities, concern the contribution of candidates to the acquisition of new housing, the prices of housing put up for sale or the means of financing these purchases.\n\nAll the questions are qualitative, with three choices. The results are balances of opinion calculated as the difference between the percentage of «up (+)» and the percentage of «down (-)»."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
