                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1705> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1705/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The frame of the survey is the Sirus directory (directory of statistical units).\n\nThe sampling method: stratification by industry and by local unit size.\n\nThe survey is exhaustive for establishments with 250 or more employees (approximately 1,800 establishments)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1705/S.3.7>
