            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The scope of the survey was narrowed compared to the 2014 edition which also included the legal units of divisions 38 (Waste collection, treatment and disposal; recovery) and 39 (Pollution control and other waste management services).  \nNote that data for the waste management sector (divisions 38 and 39) were disseminated separately.  \nNo difference with 2015."@en ;
