    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1900/S.12.1/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "A consultation committee met to take an active part in the questionnaire’s design. Its member are experts and representatives of public policies interested in ICT and e-commerce questions (SOeS, SSP, DGE, CCIP, ARCEP, SGMAP, Télécom Paris Tech…), as well as representatives for syndicates of businesses and trade unions (FEVAD, Syntec Numérique, Medef, CCIP, CPME, CGT, FO…)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
