            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The main themes of the questionnaire concern the situation of young people on the labour market (conditions of employment, trade practiced, unemployment, means used to get a job…) and their living conditions (resources, housing conditions, family situation…). The data collected can be enriched by merging with Depp education panel data."@en ;
