                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1948> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1948/S.15.2/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Until 2007, the survey was carried out each month except in August. Since 2008 it has been carried out every month."@en ;
