                    "The Agricultural means of production purchasing price aggregated indices are calculated on the basis of the Laspeyres formula with fixed base year. The base year is fixed for 5 years which means that the weighting structure, representative of the base year, is fixed for 5 years. The value weights from the weighting schemes were provided by the 2015 semi final Economic Accounts for Agriculture data."@en ;
