    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1552/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/486> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1552/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The information collected covers the paid workforce at 31 December.\n\nThe survey gives information about the gender of the workforce, status (incumbents, non incumbents, subsidised employment), employment terms (full time, part time), the principal or secondary nature of the job and the framework (hierarchical category of the agent, and the sector: administrative, technical, cultural, etc.)."@en ;
