            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey has been conducted annually, between 1980 to 2008.\n\nThe survey is conducted with head offices or main establishments of institutions."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
