                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.10.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> ;
            <http://rdf.insee.fr/def/base#additionalMaterial>
                    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/255> , <http://bauhaus/documents/document/256> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#MetadataReport> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Metadata report 1691"@en , "Rapport de métadonnées 1691"@fr .
    
    <http://bauhaus/documents/document/255>
            a                        <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Document> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label>
                    "Enquête Méthodologique - Information et Vie Quotidienne - Tome 1 : bilan du test 1, novembre 2002"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/language>
                    "fr" ;
            <http://purl.org/pav/lastRefreshedOn>
                    "2003-06-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
            <http://schema.org/url>  <https://www.insee.fr/fr/metadonnees/source/fichier/enq_methodo_info_vie_quotidienne_doctrav0202.pdf> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.19>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.7>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.7>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/territoire/franceHorsMayotte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "\"Ordinary\" households, i.e. excluding households living in institutional collective dwellings units (hostels, prisons, hospitals, etc.) and those living in mobile accommodation (e.g. boatmen, homeless people, etc.).  \nIndividual between 18 and 65 years old (a single individual per household)."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.20/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "L'Agence nationale de Lutte contre l'Illettrisme / ANLCISite internet  \n<http://www.anlci.gouv.fr>  \n\nMesurer les compétences des adultes avec l'enquête Information et vie quotidienne / IVQEconomie et Statistique n°424-425  \n<https://www.epsilon.insee.fr/jspui/handle/1/27532>"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.9>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.9>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/uniteEnquetee/H> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Regional extensions take place in the Pays-de-Loire and Nord-Pas-de-Calais regions.\n\nThe IVQ survey was also conducted in Martinique in 2006, Reunion Island in 2007 and Guadeloupe in 2008, with representative samples of the population aged between 16 and 65 years old."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Ménages dits \" ordinaires \", c'est-à-dire hors ménages vivant en collectivité (foyers, prisons, hôpitaux…) et vivant dans des habitations mobiles (mariniers, sans-abri…).  \nIndividu de 18 à 65 ans (un seul individu par ménage)."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.1.2>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.18.3/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The survey was conducted from October to December 2004 by interviewers in face-to-face interrogations using a computer-assisted data collection method (CAPI).\n\nIn order to motivate the respondents, the exercise materials were varied and not very academic, instead resembling the documents encountered in daily life (TV programmes, music CDs, etc.).\n\nThe level of difficulty of the exercise is adapted to the skill level of the person, by means of a guidance procedure after a core assessment of literacy and numeracy skills.\n\nTherefore, the persons who perform at or above a minimum standard are routed to more complex items, which allows for the definition of skills such as the ability to select the essential information in a text.\n\nOn the other hand, if the results following the procedure are poor, the respondent takes a test consisting of quite basic tasks dedicated to understand his or her difficulties in relation to written language."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6/text> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "- Les compétences en lecture, en numératie et en compréhension orale ;  \n- Les langues maternelles, d'apprentissage de la lecture, et parlée actuellement ;  \n- Les difficultés durant le parcours scolaire ;  \n- Les démarches pour trouver du travail ;  \n- Les loisirs liés à la lecture ;  \n- Le cas échéant, le processus de contournement des difficultés rencontrées dans la vie quotidienne.\n\nAfin de mieux connaître le parcours de vies des personnes enquêtées, un questionnaire biographique est proposé. Il porte sur leurs origines, les lieux où ils vivent, la scolarisation en France ou ailleurs…"@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.19/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "Des extensions régionales ont lieu en Pays de la Loire et en Nord-Pas-de-Calais.\n\nL'enquête IVQ est également réalisée en Martinique en 2006, à la Réunion en 2007, en Guadeloupe en 2008, sur des échantillons représentatifs de la population âgée de 16 à 65 ans."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/I.18.10>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.1.1>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "The sample consisted of approximately 10,400 households."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.10.6>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.10.6>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.10.6/texte> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4/text>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "- Reading, numeracy and oral comprehension skills  \n- Mother tongues, languages that people learn to read and currently speak  \n- Difficulties during school careers  \n- Job finding procedures  \n- Reading-related leisure activities  \n- If necessary, the procedures used to circumvent difficulties encountered in daily life\n\nIn order to achieve a better understanding of the pathways through life of the people surveyed, a background questionnaire is proposed, which covers their origins, their places of residence, schooling in France or elsewhere, etc."@en ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/en> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/I.18.10/texte>
            a       <http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/Text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value>
                    "L'échantillon comporte environ 10 400 ménages."@fr ;
            <http://purl.org/dc/terms/language>
                    <http://bauhaus/codes/langue/fr> .
    
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4>
            a       <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#ReportedAttribute> ;
            <http://bauhaus/qualite/simsv2fr/attribut/S.3.4>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4/texte> , <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1691/S.3.4/text> ;
            <http://www.w3.org/ns/sdmx-mm#metadataReport>
                    <http://bauhaus/qualite/rapport/1691> .
}

<http://rdf.insee.fr/graphes/qualite/rapport/1908> {
    <http://bauhaus/qualite/attribut/1908/S.8.1>
